<view class="page">
 <view class="brand">芽 · 小芽<text class="settings" bindtap="openSettings">预算与玩法</text></view><view class="eyebrow">SMALL CHOICES, EVERYDAY LIFE</view><view class="heading">把小小的 TA，养到上学。</view><view class="subtitle">奶粉、尿裤、玩具、入园……由你一项项决定。</view>
 <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><scroll-view scroll-x class="chapters"><view wx:for="{{chapters}}" wx:key="name" class="chapter {{item.active?'active':''}}">{{item.name}}</view></scroll-view>
 <view class="scene"><canvas type="2d" id="scene" class="canvas"></canvas><view class="pill">● {{stage}}</view><view class="age">{{age}}</view></view>
 <view class="task-head"><view class="title">{{last?'整理入学清单':'本期生活任务'}}</view><text>{{done}} / {{taskCount}} 已处理</text></view><view class="note">{{last?'完成入学任务后通关。':'先安排生活方式，再处理对应采购。'}} {{duration ? '本期覆盖 '+duration+' 个月。':''}}</view>
 <view class="legend"><text class="badge required">必需安排</text><text class="badge conditional">按情况必需</text><text class="badge optional">可选消费</text></view>
 <button wx:for="{{tasks}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openTask" class="quest {{item.handled?'handled':''}}"><text class="check">{{item.handled?'✓':'○'}}</text><view class="quest-text"><view>{{item.title}}</view><view class="quest-meta"><text class="badge {{item.kind}}">{{item.kindLabel}}</text><text>{{item.handled?item.label:item.category}}</text></view></view><view class="quest-price">{{item.price}}<view class="note">{{item.status}}</view></view></button>
 <view wx:if="{{!ended}}"><button class="export" bindtap="skipOptional" disabled="{{!optionalPending}}">剩余可选项全部跳过</button><button class="next" bindtap="advance" disabled="{{pending>0}}">{{last?'完成清单，迎接小学':'完成本期，进入 '+nextAge}} →</button><view class="note">{{pending?'还有 '+requiredPending+' 项需要安排，'+optionalPending+' 项可选消费待决定。':'本期全部处理完毕。继续不会额外扣费。'}}</view></view>
 <view wx:else class="result">第一章完成，小芽要上学了！累计支出 {{total}}，主动跳过 {{skipped}} 次消费。</view>
 <view class="money"><view class="subtitle">从孕期至当前 · 累计花销</view><view class="total">{{total}}</view><view class="row"><text>必需与条件支出</text><text>{{requiredTotal}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>可选消费支出</text><text>{{optionalTotal}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>本期已花</text><text>{{periodTotal}}</text></view><view class="rule"></view><view class="row"><text>到入学的参考预算</text><text>{{budget}}</text></view><view class="row {{over?'over':''}}"><text>{{over?'已超出预算':'预算余额'}}</text><text>{{remaining}}</text></view><view class="note">只有确认方案才记账，不另收统一生活费。超出预算也可以继续。</view></view>
 <view class="tabs"><text data-tab="ledger" bindtap="setTab" class="{{tab==='ledger'?'active':''}}">详细账单</text><text data-tab="categories" bindtap="setTab" class="{{tab==='categories'?'active':''}}">钱花在哪里</text><text data-tab="stages" bindtap="setTab" class="{{tab==='stages'?'active':''}}">阶段汇总</text></view>
 <view wx:if="{{tab==='ledger'}}"><button class="export" bindtap="exportBill">导出账单 CSV</button><view class="receipt" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id"><view><view>{{item.title}}</view><view class="note">{{item.time}} · {{item.kindLabel}}</view><view class="note">{{item.label}} · {{item.detail}}</view></view><text>{{item.priceText}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!rows.length}}" class="note">先完成一个任务，开始你的养育账本。</view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{tab==='stages'}}"><view class="row" wx:for="{{stageTotals}}" wx:key="name"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.price}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{tab==='categories'}}"><view class="row" wx:for="{{categoryTotals}}" wx:key="name"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.price}}</text></view></view>
 <view class="footer">游戏初始金额可按消费预算修改，不是地区均价。采购数量只用于算钱，不是喂养或医疗建议。婴儿阶段逐月、1—2岁按季、幼儿园按学期推进，终点为约6岁公办小学入学。免费项目也能完成必需任务。当前政策示例：公办园学前一年保教费为零，伙食等另列；公办义务教育学杂费为零。具体按当地执行。仅本地存档。</view>
 <view wx:if="{{taskOpen}}" class="overlay"><scroll-view scroll-y class="dialog task-dialog"><view class="badge">{{taskKind}}</view><view class="title">{{taskTitle}}</view><view class="note">{{taskDescription}}</view><view wx:if="{{taskHandled}}" class="result">{{taskReceipt}}</view><block wx:else><button wx:for="{{options}}" wx:key="id" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="selectOption" class="option {{optionIndex===index?'selected':''}}"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text class="price">{{item.priceText}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{selected}}"><view wx:if="{{paid}}"><view class="field">单价（元）</view><input type="digit" value="{{unitPrice}}" bindinput="priceChange"/><view class="field">数量（{{unit}}）</view><input type="number" value="{{quantity}}" bindinput="quantityChange"/><view class="result">本项合计 {{preview}}</view></view><view wx:else class="result">{{zeroNote}}</view></view><view class="error">{{taskError}}</view><button class="next" disabled="{{!selected}}" bindtap="confirmTask">确认方案</button></block><button class="export" bindtap="closeTask">{{taskHandled?'关闭':'再想想'}}</button></scroll-view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{settings}}" class="overlay"><view class="dialog"><view class="title">预算与玩法</view><view class="note">必需事项要安排好，可选消费可以不买。付费方案的单价和数量都能修改。旧版存档保留，本版独立存档。</view><view class="field">从孕期到入学的参考预算</view><input type="number" value="{{budgetInput}}" bindinput="budgetChange"/><button class="next" bindtap="saveSettings">保存预算</button><button class="export" bindtap="closeSettings">取消</button><button class="export" bindtap="restart">重新开始本轮…</button></view></view>
</view>
